00:05:43,333 --> 00:05:49,333
Dream big. Dance free.

2
00:11:26,666 --> 00:11:32,666
High Strung Free Dance is a music, romance, drama
film directed by Michael Damian.

3
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:16,000
Zander Raines, a dazzling and tempestuous young choreographer, gives the break of a lifetime to two hopeful artists when he casts a stunning
contemporary dancer, Barlow, and innovative pianist, Charlie, in New York’s most-anticipated new Broadway show: Free Dance.

4
00:22:53,333 --> 00:22:59,333
But the move throws off the show’s delicate creative balance when Charlie
falls hard for Barlow, while Zander embraces her as his muse.

5
00:28:36,666 --> 00:28:42,666
Zander, played by Thomas Doherty.

6
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:26,000
Charlie, played by Harry Jarvis.

7
00:40:03,333 --> 00:40:09,333
Barlow, played by Juliet Doherty.

8
00:45:46,666 --> 00:45:52,666
Oksana, played by Jane Seymour.

9
00:51:30,000 --> 00:51:36,000
Ravi, played by Ace Bhatti.

10
00:57:13,333 --> 00:57:19,333
Rose, played by Kika Markham.

11
01:02:56,666 --> 01:03:02,666
Nicholas Dimitri Constantine Galitzine ( GAL-it-seen; born
29 September 1994) is an English actor.

12
01:08:40,000 --> 01:08:46,000
After his acting debut in The Beat Beneath My Feet (2014), he appeared in an episode of the television series
Legends, and had leading roles in the 2016 teen drama films High Strung and Handsome Devil.

13
01:14:23,333 --> 01:14:29,333
He later starred in the supernatural horror film The Craft: Legacy (2020) and the musical film
Cinderella (2021), also contributing to the latter's accompanying soundtrack.

14
01:20:06,666 --> 01:20:12,666
Galitzine's break-out role was the romantic drama Purple Hearts (2022).

15
01:25:50,000 --> 01:25:56,000
He achieved further prominence for romantic dramas Red, White & Royal Blue (2023), and The Idea of You (2024),
as well as the comedy film Bottoms (2023) and the period drama series Mary & George (2024).

16
01:31:33,333 --> 01:31:39,333
In addition to acting, Galitzine has been a global menswear ambassador for fashion house
Fendi since 2023, and global fragrance ambassador for Emporio Armani since 2024.

17
01:37:16,666 --> 01:37:22,666
The tone is uplifting and emotional.
